                <pb facs="0264" n="176" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg176"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Loomis to Mr.
                            Conger.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-07-15"><hi rendition="#italic">July 15,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Etzel money should be transmitted to the Department and not to family. So
                    instruct Ragsdale.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Loomis.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
